## Key Learnings

* SOC alerts are only operationally useful when they include:

  * evidence (“why fired”) + context + clear next actions
* Investigation packets bridge detection engineering with analyst workflow:

  * detection signal → alert → triage-ready object
* Feature deviations (rz scores) provide interpretable reasoning even without ML complexity
* Confidence must be expressed conservatively since anomaly ≠ confirmed maliciousness
* Exporting JSONL mirrors how real SIEM/SOAR pipelines consume alerts

